+
+#### [FreeATS](https://github.com/freeats/freeats)
+> **Description:** FreeATS is a classic open source recruiting application aimed at organizations that want ownership of candidate data and hiring workflows without recurring SaaS spend. The repository and public positioning emphasize applicant tracking, vacancy management, and administrative recruiting tasks rather than flashy AI features. That makes it useful in this list as a practical base system recruiters can pair with open source resume parsing or LLM scoring tools. It is especially relevant for teams that prefer a conservative, server-managed deployment model. GitHub metadata: last commit date Jan 31, 2025, 43 stars, PHP, GPL-3.0.
