+![Topics](https://img.shields.io/github/stars/GagnDeep/awesome-best-ai-tools-for-recruiters-2026?style=social)
+
+> Best AI tools for recruiters 2026 is a curated list of open source GitHub projects recruiters can actually inspect, fork, and self-host. Instead of proprietary SaaS, this list focuses on recruiter-facing ATS platforms, resume parsers, candidate-matching tools, and recruiting agents that exist as public repositories and are useful for building a transparent hiring stack.
