+#### [Nueno](https://github.com/nueno-co/nueno)
+> **Description:** Nueno presents itself as an open source applicant tracking system with a modern web stack, database-backed hiring workflows, and a cleaner developer experience than older ATS projects. The repository structure and README show a product-oriented implementation with Next.js-style frontend code, business logic modules, tests, and Prisma-backed persistence. For recruiters, that makes it attractive as a modern self-hosted starting point for pipeline management, forms, and custom integrations with matching or ranking services. GitHub metadata: last commit date Jun 24, 2025, 263 stars, TypeScript, AGPL-3.0.
