+#### [OpenResume](https://github.com/xitanggg/open-resume)
+> **Description:** OpenResume is best known as an open source resume builder, but it is highly relevant to recruiters because the project includes structured resume data handling, parsing-related utilities, and a mature interface for standardizing candidate documents. The README emphasizes privacy, local editing, and ATS-friendly resume generation, which makes it useful on both sides of hiring: candidates can produce cleaner input, and recruiters can work with more structured output. It is one of the strongest maintained repositories in this ecosystem. GitHub metadata: last commit date Oct 29, 2024, 8500 stars, TypeScript, AGPL-3.0.
